<hr />
<h6>A few notes</h6>
<p>4MB of RAM might not mean much to people nowadays, so let's put it in context. My current phone, which was launched two years ago, has 12GB of RAM onboard, which is <strong>three thousand times the amount of available memory for apps</strong>. Yet most of the time it's used for rendering web pages. Go figure.</p>

